# ── Claude Code local state ──────────────────────────────────
# .claude/skills/ is 64 symlinks holding absolute paths into
# .agents/skills/. They only resolve on this machine. The real
# content lives in .agents/skills/ and is committed; skills-lock.json
# is what reproduces them. Regenerate, never commit.
.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json

